00:17:35,610 --> 00:17:38,490
!أوقفوها

223
00:17:42,820 --> 00:17:50,740
I found myself looking for you around the station in the morning

224
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,520
...إيريكو - تشان

225
00:17:51,170 --> 00:17:58,830
Because you're so important to me

226
00:17:59,070 --> 00:18:07,140
Share your sleepless nights with me

227
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:14,100
Give me half of your tears

228
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:39,520
!إيليلين

229
00:18:31,210 --> 00:18:32,340
.إنتهينا

